      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T11:27:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The point of assertions isn\u0027t to resolve situations where you could have errors, but highlight internal inconsistencies that should never happen.\n\nIt\u0027s not about exception management, it is about asserting a predicate that must always be true.\n\nIt\u0027s not about risks (impossible means zero probability, therefore no risks).",
      "parentUuid": "52842bdc_768e076a",
      "revId": "35cde9ce092f7ce4a869a015660e836b57e17e86",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
